[32m+[m[32m# StayInn — Full-Stack Hotel Booking Platform[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStayInn is a production-grade hotel booking marketplace built with **Next.js 16, TypeScript, MongoDB, Clerk Authentication, Stripe Payments, Cloudinary, and Google Gemini AI**.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt supports multi-role workflows (Customer, Owner, Admin), property management, booking and payment processing, AI-assisted content generation, and secure webhook-driven synchronization.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Live Demo[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Production:** `https://stayinn-booking-platform.vercel.app/`[m
[32m+[m
