[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Clerk authentication (Email/Password + Google OAuth)[m
[32m+[m[32m* Server-side route protection with `auth.protect()`[m
[32m+[m[32m* Role-based access control (Customer / Owner / Admin)[m
[32m+[m[32m* Webhook-based user synchronization with MongoDB[m
[32m+[m
