[32m+[m[32m* Submit owner request[m
[32m+[m[32m* Create and manage properties[m
[32m+[m[32m* Upload property images[m
[32m+[m[32m* Manage room inventory[m
[32m+[m[32m* View owner bookings[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Admin Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Review owner requests[m
[32m+[m[32m* Approve or reject owner applications[m
[32m+[m[32m* Manage users[m
[32m+[m[32m* Manage platform properties[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### AI Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* AI-generated property descriptions[m
[32m+[m[32m* AI travel assistant chat[m
[32m+[m[32m* Powered by **Google Gemini API**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Payments[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Stripe Checkout integration[m
[32m+[m[32m* Webhook-driven booking confirmation[m
[32m+[m[32m* Pending checkout reservation system[m
[32m+[m[32m* Race-condition-safe availability checks[m
[32m+[m[32m* Automatic cleanup of abandoned checkouts[m
